    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, six years after the disaster, &quot;I&quot; took a few days off on Memorial Day to invite my sister:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the news, the park next to our old home had reopened after renovations, and I wanted to visit it with her once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She agreed and showed up at the agreed time and place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She probably didn\u2019t know the true purpose of my visit, and she could never have known that this trip would ultimately become the most irreparable wound in her brother\u2019s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How he wished it were all just his imagination...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before witnessing the event unfold with his own eyes, who could be certain of the reality of this moment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 25 years old, currently working as a foreman in a construction team. At the age of nine, his parents divorced, and he lived with his older sister in their father's home until both parents passed away in an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sister:(cv:\u51ac\u7eeb)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127760/extras/751426d5028903a624ff175a0349f319.avif?t=1732276088\" width=233 height=342 /></span>The protagonist's biological sister, two years older than him. She excelled in school and consistently ranked at the top of her class. Currently, she is a senior executive at a certain company. She is capable and decisive, adhering to some form of progressive values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click----Return</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Enter----Fast forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact the Author</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Author's Bilibili/Weibo: Lingxu Zhiyou</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback/Discussion group: 901140212</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, six years after the disaster, &quot;I&quot; took a few days off on Memorial Day to invite my sister:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the news, the park next to our old home had reopened after renovations, and I wanted to visit it with her once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She agreed and showed up at the agreed time and place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She probably didn\u2019t know the true purpose of my visit, and she could never have known that this trip would ultimately become the most irreparable wound in her brother\u2019s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How he wished it were all just his imagination...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before witnessing the event unfold with his own eyes, who could be certain of the reality of this moment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 25 years old, currently working as a foreman in a construction team. At the age of nine, his parents divorced, and he lived with his older sister in their father's home until both parents passed away in an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sister:(cv:\u51ac\u7eeb)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127760/extras/751426d5028903a624ff175a0349f319.avif?t=1732276088\" width=233 height=342 /></span>The protagonist's biological sister, two years older than him. She excelled in school and consistently ranked at the top of her class. Currently, she is a senior executive at a certain company. She is capable and decisive, adhering to some form of progressive values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click----Return</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Enter----Fast forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact the Author</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Author's Bilibili/Weibo: Lingxu Zhiyou</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback/Discussion group: 901140212</p>",
    "short_description": "This is an ADV game work in the style of short story writing. On a sunny holiday, the main character returns with his sister to the place where he went when he was a child. &quot;There are so many things I want to say to her, and I want to tell her that I wish I could live with her like I used to.",
